{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 33","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of digits of all the numbers in the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e1b50a639e0aad3359c614336cacfeaa9affe87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,3,4,\\cdots ,10000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"148\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/8512e8beb35e05b279afb0fdbdb15b98211bc6e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 180001\\quad \\text{(B) } 154756\\quad \\text{(C) } 45001\\quad \\text{(D) } 154755\\quad \\text{(E) } 270001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"481\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can find the sum using the following method. We break it down into cases. The first case is the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The second case is the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The third case is the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0705411d92671faf1fe5602cfef8f353c7f0f83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. The fourth case is the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7211efdf41d2bc909e3d0549b2ab5cba0356ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/6/a5617cc5428d7285c931758d0c5dc2892a44a6e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9,999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" />. And lastly, the sum of the digits in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b19142d92b7b4f1a115c4ec91766582e2b8faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />. The first case is just the sum of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> which is, using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f8070867b03b0dc224db7e741135e07f4502c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. In the second case, every number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is used <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times in the tens place, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times in the ones place. So the sum is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/7811f741f6e21eb873c3d808b878f8ff97cd2935.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19(45)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />. Similarly, in the third case, every number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is used  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> times in the hundreds place, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times in the tens place, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times in the ones place, for a total sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2ba943c22f04e0673b0044804720b7baf66978a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$280(45)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />. By the same method, every number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is used <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7211efdf41d2bc909e3d0549b2ab5cba0356ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> times in the thousands place, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> times in the hundreds place, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> times in the tens place, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd4beaeec1aa15c400a0763d78937b0385924b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> times in the ones place, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a025382978b8f53e7794ad742e9ae8e8b8af2d88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3700(45)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, our final sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/9061c26b13570801cde000959c72260e62c62b02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45+19(45)+280(45)+3700(45)+1=4000(45)+1=\\boxed{\\text{A)}180001}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"531\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Consider the numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/6/9b6cd394b15aac9f702694845e76cbbe4eb2e3b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0000-9999$\" width=\"94\" height=\"12\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/f/3cf0833ae9239f61a6bac6c44e0613f0df712043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> digits and each has equal an probability of being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb60389ebcb3668507f4fc9d19d6187dcfb6de68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,1,2....9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />.\nThus, our desired sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de548eae98c04faa768d305f5c76bb9ff5c8625f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4000\\left( \\frac{9 \\cdot 10}{2} \\right)+1=4000(45)+1=\\boxed{\\text{A)}180001}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"378\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><i>Credit: Math1331Math</i>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>As in Solution 2, we consider the four digit numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/c/4cc566f1afd003fbca7ab68965da599f7c093bc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0000-9999.$\" width=\"98\" height=\"12\" /> We see that we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aee4ec1a1dbd6a04a2ead683a5dce1d65745a871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10000\\times4=40000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" /> digits with each digit  appearing equally.\n</p><p>Thus, the digit sum will be the average of the digits multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/3/3636107c2de2f979d801922fcba4bca8bfb4457b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40000.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" /> The digit average comes out to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90c58e96a5b88b6b9cc10002a5b5d1469b945a00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{0+9}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"48\" height=\"37\" /> since all digits are consecutive.\n</p><p>So, our answer will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d31cbd7d088ee44deed27ab0b659ac8f7e24a7f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2} \\times 40000 = 180000.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"162\" height=\"37\" /> However, since we purposely did not include <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e446b5cc283494e7ebfac8704b30717128ee158c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10000,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> we add one to get our final answer as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/e/23e895e7b54a432d4850f47e5fce68c3cc7b66c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}180001}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"98\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>Solution by davidaops.\n</p><p><i>Credit to Math1331Math</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017170316\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 354/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 176/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8205/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.197      1 -total\n 61.32%    8.706      1 Template:AHSME_35p_box\n 36.46%    5.176      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13143:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017170316 and revision id 99455. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}